          Entrepreneurs define their strategy within their perception of oppor-
     tunity. They are not constrained by the present resources or capabilities but
     seek to acquire the necessary resources and capabilities. The theory of
     resource dependence states that a company’s freedom of action is limited to
     satisfying the needs of customers and investors that give it the resources to
